  The article says Ashwin was a passenger riding with Syed Mohammed on a bullet (Royal Enfield) and does not say that Ashwin was the rider; the draft's 'அஸ்வின் நிலைதடுமாறி கீழே விழுந்தார்' is consistent, but the caption and reel mention 'வீடு திரும்பும்போது' which matches the article, so no issue there. However, the reel_script says 'சையத் முகமதுவுடன் புல்லட்டில் சேலம் வந்திருந்தார்' which matches, so this is not a problem. (Disregard) — Main confirmed problem: the article says Ashwin was 'சேலம் வந்துள்ளார்' with Syed Mohammed, but the draft's 'Ashwin lost balance and fell' is consistent with the article.
