factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 6 problems
  The article never names Thathakapatti as the location of the Uzhavar Santhai; it says the 'Thathakapatti Uzhavar Santhai' in the quoted farmer's statement, so this is consistent — however the draft's slide 'loc' and headline attribute the market to Thathakapatti while the article's headline gives no location, which is acceptable only because the quote names it.
  The reel_script states the price was Rs.100 'today' context is absent, but the caption says 'நேற்று ரூ.100க்கு' (yesterday), which the article supports ('நேற்று, 100 ரூபாய்') — no issue there; however the reel_script omits that the price rose from Rs.85 'last week' in a clearly dated way, which is present, so no problem.
  The caption adds 'அதுவரை தட்டுப்பாடு நீடிக்கும்' (shortage will continue until then), an inference not stated in the article.
  The reel_script says the onion is cultivated in Veerapandi, Panamarathupatti, Ayodhyapattanam and Vazhapadi; the article says these areas cultivate small onion, which matches, but the slides_spec lists only Veerapandi, Panamarathupatti, Vazhapadi, omitting Ayodhyapattanam — a minor omission, not an error.
  slides_spec slide 4 says 'விவசாயி தங்கவேல் இதைத் தெரிவித்தார' missing the final 'ீ' (ungrammatical/typo in Tamil), and the last line 'பனமரத்துப்பட்டியைச் சேர்ந்த உழவர் சந்தை விவசாயி' repeats the farmer info redundantly without clear meaning in the slide context.
  slides_spec slide 3 line 'தினமும் 2000 கிலோ தேவை, வருவது 500 கிலோ மட்டுமே' merges two facts (demand and supply) into one sentence, which is acceptable but the article states demand exceeds 2000 kg, so 'தேவை' as exactly 2000 misrepresents the 'above 2000' claim.
